{"id":"n14756-1-9","stage":5,"title":"강렬하다 · 强烈","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14756-1-9-1","ko":"어제 본 뮤지컬 어땠어?","zh":"昨天看的音乐剧怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"뮤지컬","meaning":"音乐剧","explanation":"뮤지컬：音乐剧","readings":[{"term":"뮤지컬","audio":"/audio/685596769bed2b2a62f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57767","senseId":"1","lemma":"뮤지컬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뮤지컬","audio":"/audio/685596769bed2b2a62f2.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"685596769bed2b2a","term":"뮤지컬","zh":"音乐剧","audio":"/audio/685596769bed2b2a62f2.mp3","entryId":"57767","definition":"在大舞台上结合音乐、歌曲、舞蹈等上演的，一种具有故事情节的音乐表演。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f826bf8655462a6ef323.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14756-1-9-2","ko":"배우들의 절도 있고 강렬한 춤이 인상적이었어.","zh":"演员们干净利落、富有力度的舞蹈让我印象很深。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배우들의","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우들의","audio":"/audio/a3a3e56c24b27413c214.mp3"}},{"text":"절도","meaning":"适度，分寸，节制","explanation":"절도：适度，分寸，节制","readings":[{"term":"절도","audio":"/audio/5bfbd69b74d1072c9b43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83389","senseId":"1","lemma":"절도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절도","audio":"/audio/5bfbd69b74d1072c9b43.mp3"}},{"text":"있고","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있고","audio":"/audio/5b58e630dd85c5087c5b.mp3"}},{"text":"강렬한","meaning":"强烈","explanation":"강렬하다：强烈；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"강렬하다","audio":"/audio/0ad6a9f4113f8f2b4435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14756","senseId":"1","lemma":"강렬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강렬한","audio":"/audio/389bc8fee41a4d2e21a2.mp3"}},{"text":"춤이","meaning":"舞蹈","explanation":"춤：舞蹈；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"춤","audio":"/audio/0a72ac28b3e9721b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29542","senseId":"1","lemma":"춤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춤이","audio":"/audio/b35cabdb23bce49c4e75.mp3"}},{"text":"